 "title": {
  "zh": "手册 §14.1：Fe XIII，零阶 / 一阶划分",
  "en": "Manual §14.1: Fe XIII, zero/first-order partition"
 },
 "summary": {
  "zh": "Si 样 Fe 的 3s²3p² 五个低能级；多参考为 3s²3p²、3s3p²3d、3p⁴。先优化多参考轨道，再加入到 n = 4 的价价、核价激发。以多参考 CSF 为零阶空间，逐块 ICCUT 自动读为 9、15、20；MCDHF 和含 Breit、QED 的 CI 均采用此划分。使用现有 rcsfzerofirst 程序页指定两个列表，等价于旧手册使用 mr.exc 的方式；初始轨道显式读取 mr.w。",
  "en": "Five low levels of 3s²3p² in Si-like Fe, with multireference 3s²3p², 3s3p²3d, 3p⁴. Optimize the MR orbitals, then add valence and core–valence excitations through n = 4. The MR CSFs define the zero-order space, with automatically read block ICCUT = 9, 15, 20 for MCDHF and CI with Breit and QED. The current rcsfzerofirst form specifies the two lists explicitly instead of the old manual’s mr.exc mechanism; initial orbitals are read explicitly from mr.w."
 },
 "runtime": {
  "zh": "约 1 分钟",
  "en": "about 1 minute"
 },
